  "Entry shape: {\"ctx\": {\"G\": \"C\"|\"L\"|\"NV\"|\"PENDING\", \"UI\": ...}, \"refs\": [...], \"note\": ..., \"only_paths\": [\"ABN_Dev/\"], \"replace\": true}",
  "Levels: C confirmed; L likely; NV new-verify; PENDING waits for an in-game test. Anything but C prints a WARN.",
  "Add an entry only with evidence (base-game file:line or a closed in-game test) and put it in refs."
